	<string>「工作留痕」里录音、试听播报声音，录音只存在手机上。</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>把「工作留痕」里的录音转成文字，默认只在手机上识别。</string>
	<key>NSFaceIDUsageDescription</key>
	<string>打开「工作留痕」前验证是你本人。</string>
	<key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleURLName</key>
			<string>com.kriswu.shiftreminder</string>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>shiftreminder</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
